    },
    {
      "text": "revelation given through the Comforter, D&C 21:9 (24:5; 31:11; 75:27; 90:14). elders teach by the Comforter, D&C 28:1, 4 (50:14; 52:9). the Comforter will guide missionaries in travels, D&C 31:11 (75:27; 79:2). the Comforter knows all things, D&C 35:19 (42:17). the Holy Ghost is the Comforter, D&C 36:2 (39:6). the Comforter teaches peaceable things of kingdom, D&C 36:2 (39:6). elders to speak and prophesy by the Comforter, D&C 42:16 (52:9; 90:14). the Comforter bears record of the Father and the Son, D&C 42:17. given by the Comforter to write things of God, D&C 47:4. the Comforter teaches truth, D&C 50:14 (52:9; 75:10; 79:2; 124:97). the Lord sends another Comforter, the Holy Spirit of Promise, D&C 88:3–4. every man to hear gospel in own tongue by administration of the Comforter, D&C 90:11.",
